## 2. Digest-role verification (which digest is index vs amd64 manifest)
$ podman manifest inspect docker.io/library/ubuntu@sha256:023f8a75...
  -> single image: mediaType application/vnd.oci.image.manifest.v1+json,
     config.digest = sha256:8bf6fbc94074... (= image ID),
     layers[0].digest = sha256:cb259a83ac3d... (the pulled blob)
$ podman manifest inspect docker.io/library/ubuntu@sha256:786a8b55...
  -> mediaType application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json (multi-arch index);
     amd64/linux entry digest = sha256:023f8a753c22... (the pinned manifest)
CONCLUSION: 023f8a75 = amd64 image manifest (pinned in Containerfile FROM);
            786a8b55 = multi-arch index (recorded as INDEX_DIGEST).

## 3. Bit-identical rebuild check (two independent builds, no cache, pinned timestamp)
$ podman build --no-cache --timestamp 0 -t localhost/motifbo-env:build-a -f Containerfile .
  COMMIT localhost/motifbo-env:build-a
  8bf6fbc94074daccf0d7e43395600ddd71aa5a9e486cf0d1a19cc36583f8401e
$ podman build --no-cache --timestamp 0 -t localhost/motifbo-env:build-b -f Containerfile .
  COMMIT localhost/motifbo-env:build-b
  8bf6fbc94074daccf0d7e43395600ddd71aa5a9e486cf0d1a19cc36583f8401e

$ podman image inspect localhost/motifbo-env:build-a localhost/motifbo-env:build-b \
    --format '{{.Id}} {{.RootFS.Layers}}'
  8bf6fbc94074daccf0d7e43395600ddd71aa5a9e486cf0d1a19cc36583f8401e [sha256:98effb2dfe85d4c431f97d90482075f19e5fc3a57c2dd423d8bdfd4813620043]
  8bf6fbc94074daccf0d7e43395600ddd71aa5a9e486cf0d1a19cc36583f8401e [sha256:98effb2dfe85d4c431f97d90482075f19e5fc3a57c2dd423d8bdfd4813620043]

RESULT: PASS — build-a Id == build-b Id == pulled base Id; identical RootFS layer sets.
(Temporary tags build-a/build-b untagged after the check; the pinned base image remains.)

## 4. Rootless cgroups-v2 memory-limit verification (HOST_NOTES item; pinned digest, not tag)
$ podman run --rm --memory=512m \
    docker.io/library/ubuntu@sha256:023f8a753c22258c9fe2d0005a7d28258038da7d620e9f93e9ad78aa266f9f11 \
    cat /sys/fs/cgroup/memory.max
  536870912
RESULT: PASS — limit visible in-container (512 MiB), rootless delegation works.
